    <name>
      <text>ALG1_U06_L07_Q06</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U06_L07_Q06</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.DF.9</p><p>In a two-way table, 14 of 35 freshmen chose robotics. What is the relative frequency for freshmen who chose robotics?</p>]]></text>
