    <name>
      <text>ALG1_U06_L07_Q15</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U06_L07_Q15</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.DF.9</p><p>A two-way table compares grade level and transportation. What does a cell inside the table usually show?</p>]]></text>
